<title>USA: MAF Bancorp to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>MAF Bancorp to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>CLARENDON HILLS, Ill. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAF Bancorp Inc said Wednesday its board of directors authorized a new stock repurchase program, under which it will buy back up to five percent of its common stock over the next year.</p>
<p>The repurchased stock will be held as treasury stock to be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>MAF, the holding company for Mid America Federal Savings Bank, has 10,490,133 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
